      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563145546,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "swarm node would live here",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b8",
      "originalText": "swarm node would live here",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EoCLGDNVdIztYLzQ51jLb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 235.24957275390625,
      "y": 372.625,
      "width": 819.5008544921875,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 557951839,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 333723775,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563145546,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The VM has a private NAT address (typically 192.168.65.3); per-container IPs are not reachable from the host.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b16",
      "originalText": "The VM has a private NAT address (typically 192.168.65.3); per-container IPs are not reachable from the host.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yJANVGhrVXrd3758PPBuJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 258.5372314453125,
      "y": 442.625,
      "width": 772.925537109375,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 198371199,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 905499377,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563145546,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Inbound traffic reaches the VM through a host-side process that forwards PUBLISHED container ports.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b17",
      "originalText": "Inbound traffic reaches the VM through a host-side process that forwards PUBLISHED container ports.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UFlz6wLXZEQSuOwUiw07i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 181.70663452148438,
      "y": 512.625,
      "width": 926.5867309570312,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1697095583,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1625739423,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563145546,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Docker Desktop's docs assume a Swarm can be active on it (changing its internal IP ranges requires leaving any active Swarm).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b18",
      "originalText": "Docker Desktop's docs assume a Swarm can be active on it (changing its internal IP ranges requires leaving any active Swarm).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jtiuCSr3MIBAFnLSvlCga",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 238.84213256835938,
      "y": 632.625,
      "width": 812.3157348632812,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2138067903,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 572738769,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563145546,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "H1  Nothing forwards 2377 / 7946 / 4789 to the Engine in the default setup, so other nodes cannot reach it.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b20",
      "originalText": "H1  Nothing forwards 2377 / 7946 / 4789 to the Engine in the default setup, so other nodes cannot reach it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rMVG3HBedtxDPcyzsQLA8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 171.66412353515625,
      "y": 702.625,
      "width": 946.6717529296875,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 315458527,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2116117695,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563145546,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "H2  The user-space proxy re-originates flows, which could change the outer source IP of VXLAN packets and confuse the VTEP.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b21",
      "originalText": "H2  The user-space proxy re-originates flows, which could change the outer source IP of VXLAN packets and confuse the VTEP.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xgdfk_gVh5iDFA8chQBI6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 167.13406372070312,
      "y": 772.625,
      "width": 955.7318725585938,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2135928831,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2057538225,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563145546,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "H3  WSL mirrored networking (or netsh portproxy to the WSL VM) might make it work; MTU and firewall rules would still need care.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b22",
      "originalText": "H3  WSL mirrored networking (or netsh portproxy to the WSL VM) might make it work; MTU and firewall rules would still need care.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uru95fsrqSAiN_AVlVrxF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5.66552734375,
      "y": 852.25,
      "width": 1278.6689453125,
      "height": 37.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1324832799,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 456422623,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563145546,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Experiment to settle it: Docker Desktop + WSL2 mirrored mode, `docker swarm init --advertise-addr <host LAN IP>`, join from a Linux box, then test 2377/7946/4789, then\nan overlay ping. Record Docker Desktop and WSL versions with the result.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b23",
      "originalText": "Experiment to settle it: Docker Desktop + WSL2 mirrored mode, `docker swarm init --advertise-addr <host LAN IP>`, join from a Linux box, then test 2377/7946/4789, then an overlay ping. Record Docker Desktop and WSL versions with the result.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
  "appState": {
    "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff",
    "gridSize": null
